OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some late sunshine.
OL,7,FThen becoming cloudy overnight with
OL,8,Fsome light and patchy rain extending
OL,9,Fnortheast for a time. Freshening
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly in the northwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSome hazy sunshine in the
OL,13,Fsoutheast at first otherwise rather
OL,14,Fcloudy. Dry for much of the day then
OL,15,Fsome outbreaks of rain later. Quite
OL,16,Fwarm.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,19,FOutbreaks of rain on Sunday, turning
OL,20,Fdrier later. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,21,FMonday and Tuesday, turning warmer
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
